  "prefLabel": "Rev 2401.16 State",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2401.16 “State” means:\n\n(a) Any state of the United States or any political subdivision thereof;\n\n(b) The District of Columbia;\n\n(c) The Commonwealth of Puerto Rico;\n\n(d) A territory or possession of the United States; and\n\n(e) Any foreign country or political subdivision thereof.\n\nSource. #11032, eff 1-29-16 (from Rev 2401.11); renumbered by #11044 (formerly Rev 2401.12); renumbered by #13177 (formerly Rev 2401.14); ss by #14573, eff 5-2-26, EXPIRES: 5-2-36 (formerly Rev 2401.15)",
